# Two diagnostics, not three: both spellings are answered, and neither cascades into a second
# complaint about the rest of the parameter list or the line after it. Each points at the parameter
# name and names the type it just parsed, so the fix can be read off the message without opening
# docs/SYNTAX.md.
syntax 7:10 'ns: variadic int'
syntax 11:15 'ns: variadic int'
